== Trivia ==
* Due to a bug, the Greed Donation Machine could initially only hold a maximum of 109 coins, blowing up whenever another coin was inserted. However, this was fixed in a later update.
** The number 109 was part of the [[Keeper_ARG|ARG]] that led to the addition of The Keeper, after the initial glitch that caused it. Despite popular belief, the number has nothing to do with the Lost being datamined.<ref>https://twitter.com/edmundmcmillen/status/1026548525113307136?s=19</ref>
* The icon for the Generosity achievement is different on Steam, featuring several black lines. This is a coded message and was part of the community ARG to unlock {{c|Keeper}}.

